From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BDK Patches <patches@bdk.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:03:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] bdk: export the BDK engine's test hooks from the framework

The BDK engine has test hooks (//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h in the BDK
repository): scripted navigations served without the network, UI requests
raised for the application's own handler, script run with a user
gesture, synthetic clicks, and a count of pending work. The conformance
suite and the engine scenario tests run against the packaged runtime
through them, so the framework must export them. They are not the C ABI
and give a page nothing: each acts as the application, on its own pages.

List them in chrome/app/framework.exports and, before _ChromeMain, in
framework.order.

Used by: packages/core/tests/harness_engine.mm and the engine scenario
tests in the BDK repository.
---
 chrome/app/framework.exports | 13 +++++++++++++
 chrome/app/framework.order   | 13 +++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 26 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.exports b/chrome/app/framework.exports
index ad7ed13c9e4980b02bc52bbda39b9ff8d8f25e19..cdaa9786f01e49d874612e6780d4480d815073b4 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.exports
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.exports
@@ -99,3 +99,16 @@ _bdk_window_register
 _bdk_window_unregister
 _OBJC_METACLASS_$_BDKApplicationBase
 _OBJC_CLASS_$_BDKApplicationBase
+
+# BDK: the engine's test hooks (//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h). Not ABI.
+_bdk_testing_click
+_bdk_testing_execute_script
+_bdk_testing_forget_profiles
+_bdk_testing_intercept_all
+_bdk_testing_last_ui_outcome
+_bdk_testing_pending_work
+_bdk_testing_raise_ui_request
+_bdk_testing_run_for
+_bdk_testing_script_navigation
+_bdk_testing_simulate_key
+_bdk_testing_withdraw_ui_requests
diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.order b/chrome/app/framework.order
index 242a325e18bc6b0f8d976b6cde02c9b429125ce7..75c7e56c6eb00a5eb7ce1eeb4c788ac630c4d4c3 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.order
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.order
@@ -108,6 +108,19 @@ _bdk_unsubscribe
 _bdk_window_register
 _bdk_window_unregister
 
+# BDK: the engine's test hooks.
+_bdk_testing_click
+_bdk_testing_execute_script
+_bdk_testing_forget_profiles
+_bdk_testing_intercept_all
+_bdk_testing_last_ui_outcome
+_bdk_testing_pending_work
+_bdk_testing_raise_ui_request
+_bdk_testing_run_for
+_bdk_testing_script_navigation
+_bdk_testing_simulate_key
+_bdk_testing_withdraw_ui_requests
+
 # _ChromeMain must be listed last.  That's the whole point of this file.
 _ChromeMain
 
